00:14:27.810 --> 00:14:33.050
And by the way, I think it's also quite plausible
that there will be violence if Donald Trump

00:14:33.050 --> 00:14:35.180
loses the 2020 election.

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:38.730
But asserts that he didn't really lose that
